@startuml
actor "Менеджер" as Sales
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Flask API" as API
participant "Правила" as Rules
database "SQLite" as DB
Sales -> UI : Добавить клиента
UI -> API : POST /api/leads
API -> DB : INSERT lead
API -> Rules : apply_workflow(new lead)
Rules -> DB : INSERT first_contact task, +15 мин
API --> UI : 201 + карточка
Sales -> UI : Завершить первый контакт
UI -> API : PATCH /api/tasks/{id}
API -> DB : status=done; lead.status=В работе
Sales -> UI : Квалифицировать
UI -> API : PUT /api/leads/{id}
API -> Rules : apply_workflow(status changed)
Rules -> DB : INSERT proposal task, +2 дня
API --> UI : Обновлённая карточка
@enduml
